        "trap": "大考最常見致命陷阱：在 \"one of the greatest...\" 後面漏寫名詞複數 s (誤寫 one of the greatest inventor)；以及在 His most famous invention 後方誤填 are！",
        "book_id": "wr3",
        "unit_id": "wr3_6",
